    {
      "text": "those who endure to end will be established upon the Lord’s rock, D&C 10:69. those who endure to end shall inherit eternal life, D&C 14:7 (50:5; 66:12). those who endure to end shall be saved, D&C 18:22 (20:25, 29; 53:7). endure afflictions, for the Lord is with thee, D&C 24:8. he who endures in faith shall overcome, D&C 63:20, 47. those who harden hearts could not endure the Lord’s presence, D&C 84:24. those who will not endure chastening cannot be sanctified, D&C 101:5. those who endure in faith shall partake of glory, D&C 101:35. endure adversity well, and God shall exalt thee, D&C 121:8. those who endured valiantly will receive thrones and dominions, D&C 121:29.",
